# The phone app's local settings, read by `make store-metadata` and
# `make store-upload`. Copy to `native/.env` (gitignored) and fill in; nothing
# here is ever committed with a value.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE STORE LISTING (make store-metadata / make store-upload)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Which App Store Connect app the listing is uploaded to — the same identity
# every build takes. Also read by `make store-metadata` for the review notes'
# cross-checks.
# SHAPE: reverse-DNS, e.g. se.example.notes
# APP_BUNDLE_ID=

# The listing's name on the product page. Unset, the plain project name.
# APP_DISPLAY_NAME=

# An App Store Connect API key, for `make store-upload` (fastlane deliver).
# WHERE: App Store Connect -> Users and Access -> Integrations -> App Store
# Connect API -> a key with the App Manager role. The .p8 downloads ONCE.
# ASC_KEY_ID=
# ASC_ISSUER_ID=
# Either the path to the .p8, or its contents.
# ASC_KEY_PATH=
# ASC_KEY_CONTENT=

# The phone number App Store review rings. Never committed: this repository
# is public. The generator leaves the field out rather than upload a
# placeholder, and `make store-preflight` fails until it is set.
# SHAPE: international, e.g. +46 70 000 00 00
# ASC_REVIEW_PHONE=
